    "Main-sample failures were 3/72 old versus 4/72 new; targeted-sample failures were 1/8 old versus 0/8 new. Both totals are 4/80.",
    "The first validation-rate drop did not repeat: later runs favored the new engine. This bounded sample does not establish statistical non-inferiority or eliminate future model variance.",
